Intentionally empty.

Mounted at /hostfs in the otel-collector container when HOST_FILESYSTEM points
here (see .env.override.example). The collector's hostmetrics receiver has
root_path: /hostfs and runs the filesystem/disk/process scrapers as root, so
with the upstream default of HOST_FILESYSTEM=/ it walks the entire host root on
every scrape. On macOS that reaches TCC-protected locations (~/Documents,
~/Desktop, ~/Downloads) and Docker Desktop raises privacy prompts.

Pointing the mount at this empty directory keeps the config valid and keeps the
cpu/memory/load/network/paging scrapers working (they read /proc, not /hostfs)
while giving the filesystem scraper nothing sensitive to traverse.

Do not put files in here.
